# Files that run inside Linux containers must keep LF line endings even when
# checked out on Windows with core.autocrlf=true: a CRLF shebang makes the
# container entrypoint fail with "not found", and CRLF breaks heredocs in
# Dockerfiles and multi-line values in compose files.
*.sh          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
*.yaml        text eol=lf
